New 2 Bedrooms, with 2 suites, Private Terrace of 55m2, one parking space | Areosa, Porto. Ideal for own housing or investment with immediate profitability.

There are houses where life happens better, this is the case of this flat.

On the high ground floor, with 135.7m² of floor space including a private terrace of 55.7m², it is the kind of space that changes the routine: outdoor breakfast, plants, jacuzzi, area for the kids or simply a place to breathe without leaving the house. Ideal bet for those looking for a relaxed and harmonious atmosphere.

Inside, everything designed for everyday life: 

- Entrance hall; 

- Service toilet; 

- Open space kitchen, already equipped with hob, oven, extractor fan, microwave, Bosch dishwasher and Bosch combined refrigerator;

- Living and dining room with direct access to the terrace;

- Laundry, with bosch washing machine;

- Two suites, each with its own privacy and access to the terrace;

- Bedroom hall;

Extras:

- Aluminum frames with thermal cut;

- Double glazing;

- Electric blinds;

- Electric hot gas heat pump;

- Suspended sanitary furniture;

- Floating floor;

 - Includes 1 parking space;

- AC pre-installation, because comfort is our priority.

Supplier Location:

- Close to all services and shops;

- 2km from the University Pole, references at national level;

- Near São João Hospital;

- Metro just a few minutes away;

- Public transport at the door;

- 5 minutes from the mall;

- Direct access to the motorway and the main roads of Porto.

Areosa is one of the most valued places in Porto - and this T2, with a private terrace of 55.7m², is one of the most interesting opportunities in the area at the moment.

Delivery scheduled for mid-2027. 

